WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.019 --> 00:00:06.878
Swipe down from the top right and open Add a Control

2
00:00:06.878 --> 00:00:14.659
Search for Shortcuts and add Run Shortcut

3
00:00:14.659 --> 00:00:24.707
Choose Kotori, then select the existing Record Entry action

4
00:00:24.707 --> 00:00:35.016
Next time, tap this button in Control Center

5
00:00:35.016 --> 00:00:49.052
Enter the description and amount, then tap Done to save without opening the app

6
00:00:49.052 --> 00:00:56.333
The pending count increased. Review the entry later
